<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f2f2f2; }
      p { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #333333; font-size: 18px; }
      a { color: #ff6600; text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .btn { background-color: #ff6600; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.3s ease; }
      .btn:hover { background-color: #4d4d4d; color: #ffffff; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; background-color: #ffffff; }
      h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 30px; color: #ff6600; text-align: center; }
      .small-text { font-size: 18px; color: #333333; margin-bottom: 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>We're sorry to see you go</h1>

      <p>Hello <%= @name %>,</p>

      <p>
        We're sad to hear that you're leaving. We understand that something didn't work as you needed, and we're sorry we couldn't deliver the experience you expected.
      </p>

      <p>
        We'd love a quick call or chat to understand what happened and how we could improve. Your feedback helps us make COD King better for everyone. If there's anything we can do to win you back, we're here for it.
      </p>

      <% if @survey_url.present? %>
        <p style="text-align: center; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px;">Why did you uninstall? (30 seconds)</p>
        <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          <a href="<%= @survey_url %>" target="_blank" class="btn">Tell us why</a>
        </p>
        <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #666666; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          Or tap the closest reason:
          <% Churn::ExitSurvey::REASONS.first(6).each_with_index do |(key, label), i| %><%= ' · ' if i.positive? %><a href="<%= @survey_url %>?reason=<%= key %>" target="_blank"><%= label %></a><% end %>
        </p>
      <% end %>

      <p>
        Need help with anything—or just want to talk? Our team is one click away.
      </p>

      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" target="_blank" class="btn">Chat with us now!</a>
      </p>

      <p>We hope to hear from you and get another chance to serve you better.</p>

      <p class="small-text">Best regards,</p>
      <p class="small-text">The COD King Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
